pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# clock-hz 60
# NP-8.6 gate: with cheats on (--pinyon_shift_cheats=true), turning
# cheat_show_collectibles on in free roam puts the discount signs and barn
# finds not yet found on the pause map and the minimap with the title's own
# markers (pink dots, tan barns), beside the found signs' grey dots the title
# already draws, and turning it off takes them away again. cheat.collectibles
# logs each pass and cheat.collectible each sign and barn find with its
# position and found state.
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 600 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 780 0000 255 0 0 0 0 0
capture 900 free-roam
input 930 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 960 0020 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 966 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1050 map-before
input 1140 0020 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1146 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
cvar 1180 cheat_show_collectibles true
capture 1260 free-roam-on
input 1290 0020 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1296 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1380 map-on
input 1440 0020 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1446 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
cvar 1500 cheat_show_collectibles false
capture 1560 free-roam-off
input 1590 0020 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1596 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1680 map-off
input 1740 0020 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1746 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
stop 1780
